{"suttaId":"pv18","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Pv","vriCode":"s0507m.mul","paras":[681,742],"vripara":"207"},"segments":{"pv18:0.3":"Kaṇhapetavatthu","pv18:1.1":"“Uṭṭhehi kaṇha kiṃ sesi, ko attho supanena te;","pv18:1.3":"Yo ca tuyhaṃ sako bhātā, hadayaṃ cakkhu ca [cakkhuṃva (aṭṭha.)] dakkhiṇaṃ;","pv18:1.5":"Tassa vātā balīyanti, sasaṃ jappati [ghaṭo jappati (ka.)] kesavā”ti.","pv18:2.1":"“Tassa taṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, rohiṇeyyassa kesavo;","pv18:2.3":"Taramānarūpo vuṭṭhāsi, bhātusokena aṭṭito.","pv18:3.1":"“Kiṃ nu ummattarūpova, kevalaṃ dvārakaṃ imaṃ;","pv18:3.3":"Saso sasoti lapasi, kīdisaṃ sasamicchasi.","pv18:4.1":"“Sovaṇṇamayaṃ maṇimayaṃ, lohamayaṃ atha rūpiyamayaṃ;","pv18:4.3":"Saṅkhasilāpavāḷamayaṃ, kārayissāmi te sasaṃ.","pv18:5.1":"“Santi aññepi sasakā, araññavanagocarā;","pv18:5.3":"Tepi te ānayissāmi, kīdisaṃ sasamicchasī”ti.","pv18:6.1":"“Nāhamete sase icche, ye sasā pathavissitā;","pv18:6.3":"Candato sasamicchāmi, taṃ me ohara kesavā”ti.","pv18:7.1":"“So nūna madhuraṃ ñāti, jīvitaṃ vijahissasi;","pv18:7.3":"Apatthiyaṃ patthayasi, candato sasamicchasī”ti.","pv18:8.1":"“Evaṃ ce kaṇha jānāsi, yathaññamanusāsasi;","pv18:8.3":"Kasmā pure mataṃ puttaṃ, ajjāpi manusocasi.","pv18:9.1":"“Na yaṃ labbhā manussena, amanussena vā pana;","pv18:9.3":"Jāto me mā mari putto, kuto labbhā alabbhiyaṃ.","pv18:10.1":"“Na mantā mūlabhesajjā, osadhehi dhanena vā;","pv18:10.3":"Sakkā ānayituṃ kaṇha, yaṃ petamanusocasi.","pv18:11.1":"“Mahaddhanā mahābhogā, raṭṭhavantopi khattiyā;","pv18:11.3":"Pahūtadhanadhaññāse, tepi no [natthetthapāṭhabhedo] ajarāmarā.","pv18:12.1":"“Khattiyā brāhmaṇā vessā, suddā caṇḍālapukkusā;","pv18:12.3":"Ete caññe ca jātiyā, tepi no ajarāmarā.","pv18:13.1":"“Ye mantaṃ parivattenti, chaḷaṅgaṃ brahmacintitaṃ;","pv18:13.3":"Ete caññe ca vijjāya, tepi no ajarāmarā.","pv18:14.1":"“Isayo vāpi [isayo cāpi (vimānavatthu 99)] ye santā, saññatattā tapassino;","pv18:14.3":"Sarīraṃ tepi kālena, vijahanti tapassino.","pv18:15.1":"“Bhāvitattā arahanto, katakiccā anāsavā;","pv18:15.3":"Nikkhipanti imaṃ dehaṃ, puññapāpaparikkhayā”ti.","pv18:16.1":"“Ādittaṃ vata maṃ santaṃ, ghatasittaṃva pāvakaṃ;","pv18:16.3":"Vārinā viya osiñcaṃ, sabbaṃ nibbāpaye daraṃ.","pv18:17.1":"“Abbahī vata me sallaṃ, sokaṃ hadayanissitaṃ;","pv18:17.3":"Yo me sokaparetassa, puttasokaṃ apānudi.","pv18:18.1":"“Svāhaṃ abbūḷhasallosmi, sītibhūtosmi nibbuto;","pv18:18.3":"Na socāmi na rodāmi, tava sutvāna bhātika”[bhāsitaṃ (syā.)].","pv18:19.1":"Evaṃ karonti sappaññā, ye honti anukampakā;","pv18:19.3":"Nivattayanti sokamhā, ghaṭo jeṭṭhaṃva bhātaraṃ.","pv18:20.1":"Yassa etādisā honti, amaccā paricārakā;","pv18:20.3":"Subhāsitena anventi, ghaṭo jeṭṭhaṃva bhātaranti.","pv18:21.1":"Kaṇhapetavatthu chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Pv-a","bookName":"Petavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0507a.att","from":889,"to":966,"paras":[{"para":889,"vripara":"207","refs":["pv18:1"],"words":["kaṇhā","ko attho supanena te","sako bhātā","hadayaṃ cakkhu ca dakkhiṇaṃ","tassa vātā balīyantī","sasaṃ jappatī","kesavā"],"lines":["Tattha <b>kaṇhā</b>ti vāsudevaṃ gottenālapati.","<b>Ko attho supanena te</b>ti supanena tuyhaṃ kā nāma vaḍḍhi.","<b>Sako bhātā</b>ti sodariyo bhātā.","<b>Hadayaṃ cakkhu ca dakkhiṇan</b>ti hadayena ceva dakkhiṇacakkhunā ca sadisoti attho.","<b>Tassa vātā balīyantī</b>ti tassa aparāparaṃ uppajjamānā ummādavātā balavanto honti vaḍḍhanti abhibhavanti.","<b>Sasaṃ jappatī</b>ti “sasaṃ me dethā”ti vippalapati.","<b>Kesavā</b>ti so kira kesānaṃ sobhanānaṃ atthitāya “kesavo”ti voharīyati.","Tena naṃ nāmena ālapati."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:1"],["pv18:1"],["pv18:1"],["pv18:1"],["pv18:1"],["pv18:1"],["pv18:1"],["pv18:1"]]},{"para":890,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Tassa vacanaṃ sutvā sayanato uṭṭhitabhāvaṃ dīpento satthā abhisambuddho hutvā –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":892,"vripara":"208","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Tassa taṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, rohiṇeyyassa kesavo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":893,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Taramānarūpo vuṭṭhāsi, bhātu sokena aṭṭito”ti.","– imaṃ gāthamāha;"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":894,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Rājā uṭṭhāya sīghaṃ pāsādā otaritvā ghaṭapaṇḍitassa santikaṃ gantvā ubhosu hatthesu naṃ daḷhaṃ gahetvā tena saddhiṃ sallapanto –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":896,"vripara":"209","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Kiṃ nu ummattarūpova, kevalaṃ dvārakaṃ imaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":897,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Saso sasoti lapasi, kīdisaṃ sasamicchasi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":899,"vripara":"210","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Sovaṇṇamayaṃ maṇimayaṃ, lohamayaṃ atha rūpiyamayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":900,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Saṅkhasilāpavāḷamayaṃ, kārayissāmi te sasaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":902,"vripara":"211","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Santi aññepi sasakā, araññavanagocarā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":903,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Tepi te ānayissāmi, kīdisaṃ sasamicchasī”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":904,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Tisso gāthāyo abhāsi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":905,"vripara":"209-211","refs":["pv18:3"],"words":["kevalaṃ","dvārakaṃ","saso sasoti lapasī"],"lines":["209-211. <b>Tattha ummattarūpovā</b>ti ummattako viya.","<b>Kevalan</b>ti sakalaṃ.","<b>Dvārakan</b>ti dvāravatīnagaraṃ vicaranto.","<b>Saso sasoti lapasī</b>ti saso sasoti vilapasi.","<b>Sovaṇṇamayan</b>ti suvaṇṇamayaṃ.","<b>Lohamayan</b>ti tambalohamayaṃ.","<b>Rūpiyamayan</b>ti rajatamayaṃ.","Yaṃ icchasi taṃ vadehi, atha kena socasi.","Aññepi araññe vanagocarā sasakā atthi, te te ānayissāmi, vada, bhadramukha, kīdisaṃ sasamicchasīti ghaṭapaṇḍitaṃ “sasena atthiko”ti adhippāyena sasena nimantesi.","Taṃ sutvā ghaṭapaṇḍito –"],"lineRefs":[["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"],["pv18:3"]]},{"para":907,"vripara":"212","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Nāhamete sase icche, ye sasā pathavissitā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":908,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Candato sasamicchāmi, taṃ me ohara kesavā”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":909,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv18:6"],"words":["oharā"],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>oharā</b>ti ohārehi.","Taṃ sutvā rājā “nissaṃsayaṃ me bhātā ummattako jāto”ti domanassappatto –"],"lineRefs":[["pv18:6"],["pv18:6"],["pv18:6"]]},{"para":911,"vripara":"213","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“So nūna madhuraṃ ñāti, jīvitaṃ vijahissasi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":912,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Apatthiyaṃ patthayasi, candato sasamicchasī”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":913,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv18:7"],"words":["ñātī","jīvitaṃ","madhuraṃ","vijahissasi","ñāti"],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>ñātī</b>ti kaniṭṭhaṃ ālapati.","Ayamettha attho – mayhaṃ piya <b>ñāti</b> yaṃ ati <b>madhuraṃ</b> attano <b>jīvitaṃ,</b> taṃ <b>vijahissasi</b> maññe, yo apatthayitabbaṃ patthesīti."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:7"],["pv18:7"],["pv18:7"]]},{"para":914,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Ghaṭapaṇḍito rañño vacanaṃ sutvā niccalova ṭhatvā “bhātika, tvaṃ candato sasaṃ patthentassa taṃ alabhitvā jīvitakkhayo bhavissatīti jānanto kasmā mataṃ puttaṃ alabhitvā anusocasī”ti imamatthaṃ dīpento –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":916,"vripara":"214","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Evaṃ ce kaṇha jānāsi, yathaññamanusāsasi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":917,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Kasmā pure mataṃ puttaṃ, ajjāpi manusocasī”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":918,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv18:8"],"words":["evaṃ ce  kaṇha  jānāsī","yathaññaṃ","kasmā pure mataṃ puttaṃ"],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>evaṃ ce, kaṇha, jānāsī</b>ti, bhātika, kaṇhanāmaka mahārāja,“alabbhaneyyavatthu nāma na patthetabban”ti yadi evaṃ jānāsi.","<b>Yathaññan</b>ti evaṃ jānantova yathā aññaṃ anusāsasi, tathā akatvā.","<b>Kasmā pure mataṃ puttan</b>ti atha kasmā ito catumāsamatthake mataṃ puttaṃ ajjāpi anusocasīti."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:8"],["pv18:8"],["pv18:8"],["pv18:8"]]},{"para":919,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Evaṃ so antaravīthiyaṃ ṭhitakova “ahaṃ tāva evaṃ paññāyamānaṃ patthemi, tvaṃ pana apaññāyamānassatthāya socasī”ti vatvā tassa dhammaṃ desento –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":921,"vripara":"215","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Na yaṃ labbhā manussena, amanussena vā pana;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":922,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Jāto me mā mari putto, kuto labbhā alabbhiyaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":924,"vripara":"216","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Na mantā mūlabhesajjā, osadhehi dhanena vā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":925,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Sakkā ānayituṃ kaṇha, yaṃ petamanusocasī”ti.","– gāthādvayamāha;"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":926,"vripara":"215","refs":["pv18:9"],"words":["manussena","yaṃ","kuto labbhā","alabbhiyaṃ"],"lines":["Tattha <b>yan</b>ti, bhātika, yaṃ “evaṃ <b>jāto me putto mā marī”</b>ti <b>manussena</b> vā devena <b>vā pana na labbhā</b> na sakkā laddhuṃ, taṃ tvaṃ patthesi, taṃ panetaṃ <b>kuto labbhā,</b> kena kāraṇena laddhuṃ sakkā.","Yasmā <b>alabbhiyaṃ</b> alabbhaneyyavatthu nāmetanti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:9"],["pv18:9"]]},{"para":927,"vripara":"216","refs":["pv18:10"],"words":["mantā","mūlabhesajjā","osadhehī","dhanena vā"],"lines":["<b>Mantā</b>ti mantappayogena.","<b>Mūlabhesajjā</b>ti mūlabhesajjena.","<b>Osadhehī</b>ti nānāvidhehi osadhehi.","<b>Dhanena vā</b>ti koṭisatasaṅkhena dhanena vāpi.","Idaṃ vuttaṃ hoti – yaṃ petamanusocasi, taṃ etehi mantappayogādīhipi ānetuṃ na sakkāti."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:10"],["pv18:10"],["pv18:10"],["pv18:10"],["pv18:10"]]},{"para":928,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Puna ghaṭapaṇḍito “bhātika, idaṃ maraṇaṃ nāma dhanena vā jātiyā vā vijjāya vā sīlena vā bhāvanāya vā na sakkā paṭibāhitun”ti dassento –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":930,"vripara":"217","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Mahaddhanā mahābhogā, raṭṭhavantopi khattiyā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":931,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Pahūtadhanadhaññāse, tepi no ajarāmarā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":933,"vripara":"218","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Khattiyā brāhmaṇā vessā, suddā caṇḍālapukkussā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":934,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Ete caññe ca jātiyā, tepi no ajarāmarā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":936,"vripara":"219","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Ye mantaṃ parivattenti, chaḷaṅgaṃ brahmacintitaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":937,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Ete caññe ca vijjāya, tepi no ajarāmarā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":939,"vripara":"220","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Isayo vāpi ye santā, saññatattā tapassino;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":940,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Sarīraṃ tepi kālena, vijahanti tapassino."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":942,"vripara":"221","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Bhāvitattā arahanto, katakiccā anāsavā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":943,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Nikkhipanti imaṃ dehaṃ, puññapāpaparikkhayā”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":944,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Pañcahi gāthāhi rañño dhammaṃ desesi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":945,"vripara":"217","refs":["pv18:11"],"words":["mahaddhanā","mahābhogā","raṭṭhavanto","pahūtadhanadhaññāse","tepi no ajarāmarā"],"lines":["Tattha <b>mahaddhanā</b>ti nidhānagatasseva mahato dhanassa atthitāya bahudhanā.","<b>Mahābhogā</b>ti devabhogasadisāya mahatiyā bhogasampattiyā samannāgatā.","<b>Raṭṭhavanto</b>ti sakalaraṭṭhavanto.","<b>Pahūtadhanadhaññāse</b>ti tiṇṇaṃ catunnaṃ vā saṃvaccharānaṃ atthāya nidahitvā ṭhapetabbassa niccaparibbayabhūtassa dhanadhaññassa vasena apariyantadhanadhaññā.","<b>Tepi no ajarāmarā</b>ti tepi evaṃ mahāvibhavā mandhātumahāsudassanādayo khattiyā ajarāmarā nāhesuṃ, aññadatthu maraṇamukhameva anupaviṭṭhāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:11"],["pv18:11"],["pv18:11"],["pv18:11"],["pv18:11"]]},{"para":946,"vripara":"218","refs":["pv18:12"],"words":["ete","aññe","jātiyā"],"lines":["<b>Ete</b>ti yathāvuttakhattiyādayo.","<b>Aññe</b>ti aññatarā evaṃbhūtā ambaṭṭhādayo.","<b>Jātiyā</b>ti attano jātinimittaṃ ajarāmarā nāhesunti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:12"],["pv18:12"],["pv18:12"]]},{"para":947,"vripara":"219","refs":["pv18:13"],"words":["mantaṃ","parivattentī","chaḷaṅgaṃ","brahmacintitaṃ","vijjāyā"],"lines":["<b>Mantan</b>ti vedaṃ.","<b>Parivattentī</b>ti sajjhāyanti vācenti ca.","Atha vā <b>parivattentī</b>ti vedaṃ anuparivattentā homaṃ karontā japanti.","<b>Chaḷaṅgan</b>ti sikkhākappaniruttibyākaraṇajotisatthachandovicitisaṅkhātehi chahi aṅgehi yuttaṃ.","<b>Brahmacintitan</b>ti brāhmaṇānamatthāya brahmanā cintitaṃ kathitaṃ.","<b>Vijjāyā</b>ti brahmasadisavijjāya samannāgatā, tepi no ajarāmarāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:13"],["pv18:13"],["pv18:13"],["pv18:13"],["pv18:13"],["pv18:13"]]},{"para":948,"vripara":"220-221","refs":["pv18:14"],"words":["isayo","santā","saññatattā","tapassino"],"lines":["220-221. <b>Isayo</b>ti yamaniyamādīnaṃ paṭikūlasaññādīnañca esanaṭṭhena isayo.","<b>Santā</b>ti kāyavācāhi santasabhāvā.","<b>Saññatattā</b>ti rāgādīnaṃ saṃyamena saṃyatacittā.","Kāyatapanasaṅkhāto tapo etesaṃ atthīti <b>tapassino</b>.","Puna <b>tapassino</b>ti saṃvarakā.","Tena evaṃ tapanissitakā hutvā sarīrena ca vimokkhaṃ pattukāmāpi saṃvarakā sarīraṃ vijahanti evāti dasseti.","Atha vā <b>isayo</b>ti adhisīlasikkhādīnaṃ esanaṭṭhena isayo, tadatthaṃ tappaṭipakkhānaṃ pāpadhammānaṃ vūpasamena santā, ekārammaṇe cittassa saṃyamena saññatattā, sammappadhānayogato vīriyatāpena tapassino, sappayogā rāgādīnaṃ santapanena tapassinoti yojetabbaṃ.","<b>Bhāvitattā</b>ti catusaccakammaṭṭhānabhāvanāya bhāvitacittā."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:14"],["pv18:14"],["pv18:14"],["pv18:14"],["pv18:14"],["pv18:14"],["pv18:14"],["pv18:14"]]},{"para":949,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Evaṃ ghaṭapaṇḍitena dhamme kathite taṃ sutvā rājā apagatasokasallo pasannamānaso ghaṭapaṇḍitaṃ pasaṃsanto –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":951,"vripara":"222","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Ādittaṃ vata maṃ santaṃ, ghaṭasittaṃva pāvakaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":952,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Vārinā viya osiñcaṃ, sabbaṃ nibbāpaye daraṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":954,"vripara":"223","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Abbahī vata me sallaṃ, sokaṃ hadayanissitaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":955,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Yo me sokaparetassa, puttasokaṃ apānudi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":957,"vripara":"224","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Svāhaṃ abbūḷhasallosmi, sītibhūtosmi nibbuto;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":958,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Na socāmi na rodāmi, tava sutvāna bhātika."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":960,"vripara":"225","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Evaṃ karonti sappaññā, ye honti anukampakā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":961,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Nivattayanti sokamhā, ghaṭo jeṭṭhaṃva bhātaraṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":963,"vripara":"226","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Yassa etādisā honti, amaccā paricārakā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":964,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Subhāsitena anventi, ghaṭo jeṭṭhaṃva bhātaran”ti.","– sesagāthā abhāsi;"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":965,"vripara":"225","refs":["pv18:19"],"words":["ghaṭo jeṭṭhaṃva bhātaraṃ"],"lines":["Tattha <b>ghaṭo jeṭṭhaṃva bhātaran</b>ti yathā ghaṭapaṇḍito attano jeṭṭhabhātaraṃ mataputtasokābhibhūtaṃ attano upāyakosallena ceva dhammakathāya ca tato puttasokato vinivattayi, evaṃ aññepi sappaññā ye honti anukampakā, te ñātīnaṃ upakāraṃ karontīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:19"]]},{"para":966,"vripara":"226","refs":["pv18:20"],"words":["yassa etādisā hontī","amaccā","etādisā","yassa"],"lines":["<b>Yassa etādisā hontī</b>ti ayaṃ abhisambuddhagāthā.","Tassattho – yathā yena kāraṇena puttasokaparetaṃ rājānaṃ vāsudevaṃ ghaṭapaṇḍito sokaharaṇatthāya subhāsitena anvesi anuesi, <b>yassa</b> aññassāpi <b>etādisā</b> paṇḍitā <b>amaccā</b> paṭiladdhā assu, tassa kuto sokoti!","Sesagāthā heṭṭhā vuttatthā evāti."],"lineRefs":[["pv18:20"],["pv18:20"],["pv18:20"]]}]},"tika":null}
